actices",{"title":250,"path":251,"stem":252},"What are Digital Twins?","\u002Fblog\u002Fwhat-are-digital-twins","blog\u002FWhat are Digital Twins",{"title":254,"path":255,"stem":256},"What makes Mixed Reality the next big thing?","\u002Fblog\u002Fwhat-makes-mixed-reality-the-next-big-thing","blog\u002FWhat makes Mixed Reality the next big thing",{"title":258,"path":259,"stem":260},"Why Game Engines?","\u002Fblog\u002Fwhy-game-engines","blog\u002FWhy Game Engines",{"title":262,"path":263,"stem":264},"Why we need User Experience Design?","\u002Fblog\u002Fwhy-we-need-user-experience-design","blog\u002FWhy we need User Experience Design",false,{"id":267,"title":22,"author":268,"body":272,"date":329,"description":330,"extension":331,"image":332,"meta":333,"minRead":334,"navigation":335,"path":23,"seo":336,"stem":24,"__hash__":337},"blog\u002Fblog\u002F5 Things to motivate you to perform Unit Testing.md",{"name":269,"avatar":270},"Aghil Jose",{"src":271,"alt":269},"\u002Fassets\u002Fimages\u002Fabout.webp",{"type":273,"value":274,"toc":323},"minimark",[275,280,284,291,294,299,302,307,310,314,317,320],[276,277,279],"h2",{"id":278},"_1-reduce-the-number-of-bugs","1. Reduce the Number of Bugs",[281,282,283],"p",{},"Taking care of bugs is not only tedious and time-consuming, but issues that\nappear in production are much more complex than if they had have been\ndiscovered in development or staging. By adding unit tests, failures can be\ndetected early on, pretty much as soon as the code is written and the team\nwould be able to take care of any unintended defect without any complications.",[281,285,286,290],{},[287,288,289],"strong",{},"2. Improve Code Design"," **",[281,292,293],{},"When you consider implementing unit testing, you have to make sure that your\ncode is testable. Think about it, when you deal with the overall design\nconcept, and you need break down the high-level design to ‘single\nentity-multiple components’, you’ll be forced to think of each unit and make\nsure each of them is testable. This improves the overall code design by clear\nunit separation, defining better unit interfaces and the design concept.",[281,295,296,290],{},[287,297,298],{},"3. Improves Teamwork",[281,300,301],{},"Along with the documentation, it improves teamwork. Your colleagues can review\nthe logic behind your code and coordinate their code accordingly. Being able\nto review each other’s code, the teamwork is more cohesive and Agile.",[281,303,304,290],{},[287,305,306],{},"4. Inspires Confidence",[281,308,309],{},"You develop software and then you write tests to examine if it works. You will\nbe able to validate in the early stages whether your code is actually\nfunctional. Once your tests are passed, you feel confident knowing that your\nsoftware is in good shape. Many issues could be avoided this way - not\neverything.",[276,311,313],{"id":312},"_5-easier-changes-and-refactoring-of-code","5. Easier Changes and Refactoring of Code",[281,315,316],{},"Automated unit tests catches bugs easily and knowing that makes you feel more\nconfident. Once an issue is detected, you feel more at ease when you have to\nmake changes to your code, even if the changes are beyond trivial ones – any\ncode issue detected before it’s released to production is a victory!",[281,318,319],{},"We as developers hesitate to add unit testing to our work routine. Some\nrefuse to do so because writing extra code adds more time and effort to an\nalready busy day. What is often not considered is that going the extra mile\nmay save time in the long run. Eliminating unit testing is only time-saving\nif your code is going to work bug free.",[281,321,322],{},"Disclaimer : The views and opinions expressed in the article belong solely to the\nauthor, and not necessarily to the author's employer, organisation, committee\nor other group or individual.",{"title":324,"searchDepth":325,"depth":325,"links":326},"",2,[327,328],{"id":278,"depth":325,"text":279},{"id":312,"depth":325,"text":313},"2020-04-13","An article that describes the reasons to do Unit Testing.","md","\u002Fassets\u002Fimages\u002Fblog\u002F130420\u002Funit.webp",{},3,true,{"title":22,"description":330},"2J-r9my133MshYzVYsu-hU2HnhB5h9xk15GdtygfAac",[339,342],{"path":19,"title":18,"description":340,"date":341},"An article regarding usual mistakes made by most Front-end Developers\u002FEngineers.","2020-04-20",{"path":15,"title":14,"description":343,"date":344},"An article to inspire you to perform End to End Testing in application.","2020-04-04",1790338182927]